{"id": "EUVD-2026-70777", "enisaUuid": "7a17d8aa-a7ed-3295-8ca4-2133bb3a9c78", "description": "MOOS core-moos through 10.4.0 contains a denial of service vulnerability in MOOSCommServer::ListenLoop() where the accept thread performs a blocking receive without timeout during the wire-protocol handshake. An attacker can open a TCP connection to the MOOSDB port and send no data, causing the accept thread to block indefinitely while holding the socket-list lock, preventing all subsequent client connections.", "datePublished": "2026-09-03T22:38:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-14T13:50:51", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/themoos/core-moos/pull/83", "https://github.com/themoos/core-moos/commit/8d940303949a850d4625eca2a60f27adee9c3ec4", "https://github.com/themoos/core-moos", "https://github.com/themoos/core-moos/blob/ec9c77c68fcbdef8f5e4c60fe243acd223433f0c/Core/libMOOS/Comms/MOOSCommServer.cpp#L922", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/moos-core-moos-through-10.4.0-moosdb-accept-loop-denial-of-service"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-85443", "GHSA-qqc5-c4q6-4q3x"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.63, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d7061a95-5d38-392b-976c-9fca33de3e1f", "product": {"name": "core-moos", "vendor": {"name": "themoos"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226410.4.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "06198859-5acb-37db-9bf9-762b15cb5ce1", "vendor": {"name": "themoos"}}], "isExploited": false}